OL,3,AFive ways El Nino is affecting the
OL,4,Aweather around the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl Nino has been strengthening for
OL,7,Fseveral months now and is already
OL,8,Fhaving a significant impact on global
OL,9,Fweather patterns.
OL,11,FCountries including Indonesia, India
OL,12,Fand the United States have been
OL,13,Fexperiencing droughts, floods and
OL,14,Fheatwaves in line with projections
OL,15,Fabout how extreme weather events will
OL,16,Fbe supercharged by the phenomenon.
OL,18,FThe World Meteorological Agency says
OL,19,Fthe record-breaking El Nino will
OL,20,Fstrengthen further and persist until at
OL,21,Fleast 2027.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
